sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cl as Client
    participant Pool as Connection pool
    participant Lim as Rate limiter
    participant API as Server
    Cl->>Pool: many requests
    Pool->>Pool: reuse connections — a new TLS handshake per request is the usual mistake
    Pool->>Lim: bounded concurrency
    Note over Lim: more parallelism than the server allows just converts into 429s
    Lim->>API: dispatch
    alt 429 with Retry-After
        API-->>Lim: back off
        Lim->>Lim: honour the header, add jitter
        Lim->>API: retry
    else success
        API-->>Cl: response
    end
    Note over Pool,API: batch where the API supports it — one request beats ten perfectly-paced ones
